; Opt-in synchronous Data-Out test. One block near the end of the disk is
; saved asynchronously, written/read synchronously, then restored and verified
; asynchronously. For another place, add: LBA n
FailAt 21
Echo "Experimental sync WRITE test: one saved/restored medium block."
Set u `MCDiag FINDUNIT`
MCDiag UNIT $u SYNC WRITE LOG DF0:mcsync-write.log
Echo "Done. Check DF0:mcsync-write.log for the restore result."
